      "turns": [
        {
          "turn": 1,
          "speaker": "Jazlynn",
          "text": "[bitter laugh] You kept provoking people and acting untouchable. I thought one hard hit would make you stop."
        },
        {
          "turn": 2,
          "speaker": "Sandra",
          "text": "[long yawn] My head is pounding and I can't focus. Put the bat away and call emergency services."
        },
        {
          "turn": 3,
          "speaker": "Jazlynn",
          "text": "[sleepy yawn] I've been up all night, but that doesn't excuse what I did. The bat is on the ground; I'm calling now."
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "speaker": "Sandra",
          "text": "[voice breaking, crying] I picked fights, but I didn't deserve to be hit. Tell them exactly what happened."
        },
        {
          "turn": 5,
          "speaker": "Jazlynn",
          "text": "[embarrassed laugh] I called it teaching you a lesson because I didn't want to admit I lost control. I won't lie to them."
        },
        {
          "turn": 6,
          "speaker": "Sandra",
          "text": "[resigned sigh] Fine. Then say you swung it, and say I need help before we argue about anything else."
        },
        {
          "turn": 7,
          "speaker": "Jazlynn",
          "text": "[long sigh] You're right. The dispatcher says to keep you still, and I'm staying here until the ambulance arrives."
        },
        {
          "turn": 8,
          "speaker": "Sandra",
          "text": "[disbelieving laugh] Staying here doesn't undo it. After the doctor checks me, I want the police to hear my side."
        },
        {
          "turn": 9,
          "speaker": "Jazlynn",
          "text": "[exhausted yawn] They will. I'll give a statement and accept whatever comes from it."
        },
        {
          "turn": 10,
          "speaker": "Sandra",
          "text": "[sigh of relief] The paramedic says nothing looks broken, but they're taking me in for scans. Don't follow me into the exam room."
        },
        {
          "turn": 11,
          "speaker": "Jazlynn",
          "text": "[remorseful sigh] I understand. I'm sorry I hurt you, and I'll wait where the officers tell me to."
        },
        {
          "turn": 12,
